    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Things are certainly different than I remember. Just how big *is* this
        place?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: You're right, it's a miracle i made it to your hidey hole, without sight,
        avoiding all these dangers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Hm, yes very mysterious...and it wasn't a "hole"! It was my sacred place
        of rest before you and those shades came crashing in!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Ah well, nothing we can do about it now. On we go!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
